{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:i1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin with, you should choose your destination and calculate the distance."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures process initiation and the first explicit step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:i2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "While doing so, continue to check if you need to book a train or a flight."
      ],
      "justification": "Models the ongoing check that triggers the transport decision split."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->i3",
        "action:i3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the answer is \"no\", then proceed to book a train."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard encodes the negative condition; action captures the corresponding booking step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->i4",
        "action:i4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the answer is \"yes\", then book a flight."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard encodes the positive condition; action captures flight booking; convergence rejoins the flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->i5",
        "action:i5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If a code is available within 24 hours, the process will end."
      ],
      "justification": "Branch and guard model the time window condition; action and end node capture the early termination path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->i6",
        "action:i6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Otherwise, if 24 hours have passed, you should call a travel agency."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard models the elapsed-time condition; action captures the fallback step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->i7",
        "action:i7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If a code is available, the process will end along with the hotel reservation."
      ],
      "justification": "Branch and guard model code availability; action and end node capture reservation completion and termination."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->i8",
        "action:i8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "On the other hand, if a code is not available, you should cancel your journey. In that case, the process will end as well."
      ],
      "justification": "Guard models code unavailability; action captures cancellation; end node marks the final termination point."
    }
  ],
